            <ArticleTitle>Unusual sciatica: traumatic rupture of the ligamentum flavum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>523-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of acute traumatic rupture of the ligamentum flavum. A condition occurring where there had been histological evidence of previous ligamentous damage. The symptoms were extreme and the surgical treatment highly effective.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
